    "Details": "Introduced after the Jihad, the Balac Strike VTOL was an extremely fast and versatile VTOL. The spotter variant developed in 3079 reduced the size of the ammo bay to free up weight for an ECM Suite and Active Probe, trading the ER Medium Laser for TAG.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 11/17 hexes / 330/510 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>        95     15\n<b>Left</b>          65     15\n<b>Right</b>        65     15\n<b>Rear</b>         45     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      285     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color>",
